          "op": "==",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "I can't bother to make lunch today. I think I'll order takeout... ...are you judging me?",
          "style": "thought",
          "expression": "thinking"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-evening",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "evening"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "...",
          "expression": "neutral"
        }
      ],
      "prompt": "Before I start writing...",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Why are you here all day, every day?",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Because I live here and I'm a freelance writer. No more questions. Now write.",
              "expression": "serious"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Tell me I did a good job!",
          "lines": [
            {
              "text": "Write first, then we'll talk.",
              "expression": "muse"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-midnight",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "midnight"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Good to see you. It's a bit late. Thinking of writing?",
          "expression": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d2-ultra_late",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "ultra_late"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Is staying up late like this typical for you? I'm not used to people being awake at the same time as me this late.",
          "expression": "muse"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "d8-morning-yes",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "morning"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 8
        },
        {
          "var": "missedDays",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "You know, you've been at this for a week and you haven't missed a single day yet. You're really committed to this, aren't you?",
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      ],
      "note": "v1: [MISSED_DAYS] = 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8-morning-no",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "morning"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 8
        },
        {
          "var": "missedDays",
          "op": "!=",
          "value": 0
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "We've missed a few days this past week. It's fine. Let's take today to get back on track and get writing. I believe in you. Don't forget that. Understood?",
          "expression": "muse"
        }
      ],
      "note": "v1: [MISSED_DAYS] = 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "d8-late_morning",
      "trigger": {
        "type": "time_slot",
        "value": "late_morning"
      },
      "when": [
        {
          "var": "day",
          "op": "==",
          "value": 8
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "Thinking about it, it's honestly inspiring that you've made a goal for yourself and you're pursuing it so diligently, {player}. I'll support you all the way.",
          "expression": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
